# Copy this file to `scripts/.env` and fill in the real values.
# scripts/.env is gitignored and MUST NEVER be committed. This template is safe to
# commit because it holds only names and placeholders — never a real value.
#
# The runner loads scripts/.env automatically for `--backend real` (config.py).
# The synthetic backends (fake/http) need none of this.
#
# Per-subject values (agent ids, csv names, enrichment list names) live in the
# FOLLOWER_CONFIG.json for that subject's run directory — see config/FOLLOWER_CONFIG.example.json.

# --- required ---------------------------------------------------------------

# PhantomBuster API key. Console -> Settings -> API (the X-Phantombuster-Key value).
PHANTOMBUSTER_API_KEY=

# --- NOT stored: the LinkedIn session -------------------------------------
#
# The li_at cookie, userAgent, and identityId are fetched LIVE from each agent
# (GET /agents/fetch) right before every launch — the freshest session PhantomBuster
# holds, exactly as n8n's "Get an agent" node does. So there is nothing to paste and
# nothing to keep fresh here. The API key above is the only credential needed.

# --- optional overrides (normally leave unset) ------------------------------

# Only set these to FORCE a specific session instead of the live-fetched one (an
# escape hatch, e.g. debugging). Unset = fetched live.
# LINKEDIN_COOKIE=
# LINKEDIN_USER_AGENT=
# PB_IDENTITY_ID=
